{"title":"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/6/bb60e0857a2c0a2c47acfbe81781032feb1f7150.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c,d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> are positive real numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/6/bb60e0857a2c0a2c47acfbe81781032feb1f7150.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c,d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> form an increasing arithmetic sequence and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/4/a643bcc8195884f4fc1e16966f6f3d6ad6fe2c27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"18\" /> form a geometric sequence, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/b/cebd1d6d15ed13c1bb9224a0971ee1a738055652.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac ad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"12\" height=\"33\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/b/e2bbd73c87d9c8e8e344f739b7ffe6a191484c0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\frac 1{12} \\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ \\frac 16 \\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\frac 14 \\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\frac 13 \\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\frac 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"370\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We can let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d65baaf9671227780dd04ab952911036aa5c868.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/7/8271d4342b38d2ab38bb626ffad8b9dae00b5e2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=3$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/4/5e4b2503862ce82e4cb89da832f5ccedae370ede.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/e/97eeb6ae31984ba115d8347522e8730e514016cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{d}=\\boxed{\\frac{1}{4}}  \\Longrightarrow \\mathrm{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"127\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>As <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/3/7735e0c99a5772e345ffad70b8728d89b4e82455.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> is a geometric sequence, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/f/25f5f831a9a1492b5df52c6c4202bd209e33811f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=ka$\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/2/f52fe0d88b7987274898cc82423bae4cbec3972d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=k^2a$\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" /> for some <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/e/67e6630318d8cb28de2723180b6d359b972489c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />. \n</p><p>Now, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/c/42c06de735d79f0b28c30bcbbcf96e67bb1ca42c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c, d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is an arithmetic sequence. Its difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/6/4464e62fd7bfb8dc6476bbaae1befd62f0234528.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-a=(k-1)a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"128\" height=\"18\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/1/2711a08eebd757b137eb2846a008a855142ff5e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=a + 3(k-1)a = (3k-2)a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"238\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Comparing the two expressions for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/4/87499942c3f3ab270745939796cd07c6aeb84367.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^2=3k-2$\" width=\"91\" height=\"15\" />. The positive solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/6/4f681bd84648c174d45eed0037702cae77ed0686.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=2$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/2/132ba796194ff44224a3d8f44c41c207ed2625e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{d}=\\frac{a}{k^2a}=\\frac{1}{k^2}=\\boxed{\\frac{1}{4}} \\Longrightarrow \\mathrm{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"228\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Letting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> be the common difference of the arithmetic progression, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/4/454bcbc31661dc56dcb8824e0a0b0b09e879be63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = a + n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/2/722631ccb964c0326623018859fc9fae8fdb32a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = a + 2n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/c/5ec1875b996eed6d888268930a4103a5cc52d556.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = a + 3n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />. We are given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/2/a22d72fc66fb5191af25650b4fbbc6645baa696a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b / a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/e/c5ecd3764c78daae2b11aa328a4456b12408b569.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d / b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />, or\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/0/5d048c478d3ca0b242e47b5621c7d854827cbf34.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a + n}{a} = \\frac{a + 3n}{a + n}.\\]\" width=\"128\" height=\"39\" />\nCross-multiplying, we get \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/6/53646d5adaf792f94b95c1d9f0b0d4148a1b6a59.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2 + 2an + n^2 = a^2 + 3an\\]\" width=\"201\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/4/5642d779ac0ea9621db97907b6908c51276813e5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n^2 = an\\]\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/3/f03bdc2df1bf326925e364582a4a26ca2c5483a0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n = a\\]\" width=\"44\" height=\"8\" />\nSo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/1/8216e4dfca6f105e0f367286d7a9828f70ef04be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{d} = \\frac{a}{a + 3n} = \\frac{a}{4a} = \\boxed{\\frac{1}{4}}  \\Longrightarrow \\mathrm{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"254\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B\">2002 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016223955\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.200 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 263/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2296/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 156/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5854/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   15.7